## 📖 Surah 108 (Surah Al-Kawthar) se Related Ahadith

**(Roman Urdu – Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim)**

---

## 1. Al-Kawthar kya hai?

Hazrat Anas bin Malik (RA) riwayat karte hain:

“Ek martaba Nabi ﷺ hamare darmiyan thay, phir aap ﷺ ko halki si neend aayi. Jab aap ﷺ muskurate hue uthe to farmaya:
‘Abhi mujh par ek Surah nazil hui hai,’ phir aap ﷺ ne Surah **Inna a’tainakal Kawthar** padhi.

Phir farmaya:
‘Kya tum jante ho Kawthar kya hai? Yeh ek nahar hai jo mere Rabb ne mujhe Jannat mein di hai.’”

**Reference:**
Sahih Muslim Hadith 400

---

### Samajh (Roman Urdu)

* Kawthar Jannat ki ek عظیم nahar hai
* Yeh Allah ki taraf se Nabi ﷺ ke liye special gift hai
* “Kawthar” ka matlab bohot zyada khair bhi hota hai

---

## 2. Hawd-e-Kawthar (Qayamat ke din)

Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Mera Hawd ek mahine ke safar jitna hoga, us ka pani doodh se zyada safed hoga aur us ki khushboo mushk se zyada achi hogi. Us ke bartan aasman ke sitaron ki tarah honge. Jo us se ek martaba pee lega kabhi pyasa nahi hoga.”

**Reference:**
Sahih al-Bukhari Hadith 6579
Sahih Muslim Hadith 2292

---

### Samajh

* Yeh Nabi ﷺ ka Hawd hai Qayamat ke din
* Momineen is se pani piyenge
* Yeh bohot badi basharat hai

---

## 3. Kuch log Hawd se door kiye jayenge

Hazrat Abu Hurairah (RA) riwayat karte hain ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Mere kuch ummati Hawd par mere paas aayenge lekin unhein mujh se door kar diya jayega. Main kahunga: Yeh mere ummati hain! To kaha jayega: Aap nahi jante ke aap ke baad inhone kya changes kiye.”

**Reference:**
Sahih al-Bukhari Hadith 6582
Sahih Muslim Hadith 2297

---

### Samajh

* Sunnah par qayam rehna bohot zaroori hai
* Deen mein bid’ah aur changes dangerous hain

---

## 🌿 Surah Al-Kawthar ka Main Message

* Allah ne Nabi ﷺ ko bohot zyada khair di
* Namaz aur qurbani sirf Allah ke liye
* Dushman hi asal mein “abtar” (cut off) hai

